rari ahead of Hunt, Andretti, Peterson, Tambay and Villeneuve.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":63,"text":"Reutemann meanwhile had no challengers for the lead all race long, and won by a comfortable margin ahead of former double world-champion Fittipaldi, Lauda, Andretti in the remaining Lotus, Clay Regazzoni in the Shadow and Didier Pironi in the Tyrrell.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}